Madagascar 3: Europe's Most Wanted is a animation,
family, comedy film directed by Eric Darnell.

3
00:12:07,826 --> 00:12:13,826
Animal pals Alex, Marty, Melman, and Gloria are still trying to
make it back to New York's Central Park Zoo.

4
00:16:10,434 --> 00:16:16,434
They are forced to take a detour to Europe to find the penguins and
chimps who broke the bank at a Monte Carlo casino.

5
00:20:13,043 --> 00:20:19,043
When French animal-control officer Capitaine Chantel DuBois picks up their scent,
Alex and company are forced to hide out in a traveling circus.

6
